.TH MICROPOLIS 6 "August 2026" "Micropolis" "Games"
.SH NAME
micropolis \- classic real-time city management simulator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B micropolis
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Micropolis
is the historical X11/Tcl/Tk city simulation released as free software by
Electronic Arts and maintained by Don Hopkins.  The Debian launcher sets the
required data directory and starts the native simulator.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/games/micropolis
Game resources, scenarios, Tcl scripts and manual.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/games/micropolis/sim
Native simulator executable.
.SH SEE ALSO
The original HTML manual is available at
.I /usr/share/games/micropolis/manual/index.html .
